## generated by `.agents/skills/samye-visual-models/scripts/extract_game_assets.ps1`.
##
## Architecture Notes (Senior Dev Guidelines):
## 1. Single Source of Truth: All sprite & reference sheet paths live here as constants.
##    Gameplay scripts never hardcode "res://assets/..." strings.
## 2. Export-Safe Loading: Uses `ResourceLoader.exists()` first (required for exported .pck / Web
##    builds where raw files are compiled into `.ctex`), and falls back to `Image.load_from_file()`
##    only during local editor development before Godot's initial asset import pass completes.

